## modeler-mod09: solid tools in the Edit menu of the modeler (menu.rs, app.rs)

modeler-edit-solid = Solid Tools
modeler-solid-check = Check Solid
modeler-solid-swap = Swap Order
modeler-solid-order-normal = The older solid is the first one again.
modeler-solid-order-swapped = The newer solid is the first one now.
modeler-entity-open-edges = Open edges
modeler-entity-open-edges-value = { $count ->
        [one] One edge
       *[other] { $count } edges
    }; use Edit > Solid Tools > Check Solid
modeler-solid-snap-retry = Snap and retry
modeler-solid-snap-retry-tip = Move the vertices onto the face planes and run the operation again. It is one undo step.
